00:29:13.000 --> 00:29:57.000
set rules establishing how when one princeps dies, a new princeps comes to power. And so the moment Caligula falls ill, it looks like he's going to die. All the heavyweights in his administration are scrabbling around trying to work out who his successor will be. And the obvious successor is this young lad, Gamelis, kind of 13 or 14 by this point, Tiberius' only grandson. So they are going off and kind of paying court to him and preparing to elevate him to the throne. And meanwhile, there is this absolute toady, this lickspittle, a guy called Atenius who swears a solemn oath that if only the gods will restore Caligula to health, then he will go into the arena and fight publicly as a
建立了一套规则，规定当一个元首（princeps）去世时，新元首是如何上台的。因此，当卡igula病倒的瞬间，看起来他快要死了。他政府里所有的大人物都在四处奔忙，试图弄清楚谁会是他的继承人。而显而易见的继承人就是这个叫加梅利斯的年轻小伙子，当时大约13或14岁，是提比略唯一的孙子。所以他们都跑去向他朝贡，并准备将他推上王位。与此同时，有一个绝对的马屁精、奴才，一个叫阿特尼乌斯（Atenius）的家伙，他发下庄严的誓言，只要神明能让卡igula恢复健康，他就会亲自走进竞技场，公开进行角斗士

46
00:29:57.000 --> 00:30:42.000
gladiator. And obviously he doesn't expect that this would happen. It would be unthinkable for someone of his rank and age to go into the arena and fight a trained killer. But you know, he's basically hedging his bets. If Caligula survives then it'll be great. You know, he'll approve of his loyalty and if he doesn't, then no one will remember it. Caligula does recover, I think against the odds. And he rises from his sickbed and he's informed what Artanis has done and also more significantly what the captain of the Praetorians and you know, his leading senatorial backers, what they've been up to going around and paying court to Gamelas and he moves with absolute lethal dispatch. So first off, he sends two soldiers to Gamelas who sit the boy down and take out their knives and show Gamelas the best
战斗。显然他并没有指望这会发生。对于他这种身份和年龄的人来说，走进竞技场与一个受过训练的杀手搏斗是不可想象的。但你知道的，他基本上是在给自己留后路。如果卡igula活下来，那太好了。你知道的，他会赞赏他的忠诚；如果他没活下来，那么也没人会记住这事。卡igula确实康复了，我认为这超出了预期。他从病榻上站起来，得知了阿特尼乌斯做了什么，更重要的是，近卫军指挥官和他的主要元老院支持者们一直在到处向加梅利斯朝贡，他以极其致命的速度采取了行动。首先，他派了两名士兵去找加梅利斯，让这名男孩坐下，掏出他们的刀，向加梅利斯展示了最好的

