00:30:42.000 --> 00:31:34.000
way to kill himself and then stand there and watch while Gamalus kills himself. And that's the end of him. Gamalus' would-be patrons, including the prefect of the Praetorians, are likewise ordered to commit suicide, which they do. And Aetanius, this guy who has vowed that he will fight a gladiator, if only Caligula recovers. Well, so this is what Suetonius says happened. Caligula takes him at his word and he forces this poor guy. I mean, he's not at all the kind of person who is fitted either by background or I think by physique to face up to a trained gladiator out into the arena. Atenius is killed very briskly, he's dragged off with a hook across the sand, his body is dumped and Caligula's sense of humor has this kind of bloody punchline.
自杀方法，然后站在那里看着加梅利斯自杀。这就是他的结局。加梅利斯的准支持者们，包括近卫军长官，同样被命令自杀，他们也照做了。而阿特尼乌斯，这个曾发誓只要卡igula康复就去当角斗士的家伙，嗯，苏维托尼乌斯就是这么记录的。卡igula当真了，他强迫这个可怜的家伙——我的意思是，无论是从背景还是我认为从体格来看，他根本就不是那种适合去竞技场面对受过训练的角斗士的人。阿特尼乌斯非常利落地被杀死了，他被用一个钩子拖过沙子，尸体被随意抛弃，而卡igula的幽默感有着这种血腥的笑点。

